{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.poster.avif?t=1757962728\" aria-label=\"A slow, suspenseful pan through a mid-90s suburban dining and living room, steeped in darkness, ends on a boxy television set flickering with a regional weather forecast.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.webm?t=1757962728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.mp4?t=1757962728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Grandma has changed\u2014and not for the better. Tonight, something ancient takes hold of her, twisting her into a vessel for the Devil itself. Before the darkness fully claims her, she leaves you one final warning: whatever you do\u2026 <strong>DON\u2019T LOOK AT GRANDMA.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside, descend into Grandpa\u2019s hidden chamber, and attempt the ritual that might save her soul\u2014if you can make it through the night.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perform the Ritual</strong> \u2013 Search every shelf, drawer, closet, and cabinet for five sacred heirlooms needed to banish the Devil and save Grandma's soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Look at Grandma</strong> \u2013 The Devil only wins if you make eye contact, and Grandma has a way of appearing where you least expect her...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets Beneath the House</strong> \u2013 Discover the origins of a generational curse and uncover long-buried truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Horror</strong> \u2013 Each run reveals new ritual items, curses, and blessings, daring you to face fresh challenges and surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light the flames. Gather the heirlooms. Face the Devil. Complete the ritual. <br>And whatever you do\u2026 <strong>DON\u2019T LOOK AT GRANDMA. </strong> <br><br><i>Developer note:\u00a0 Grandma's house is a loving recreation of my actual Grandma's house, circa 1996!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976990?t=1757962728","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/946bfda2110478d2b64455e71938f81e02df7a3d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757962728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/1744877717309f6ea117e8d0192a6d642b1987d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757962728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/1744877717309f6ea117e8d0192a6d642b1987d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757962728","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.poster.avif?t=1757962728\" aria-label=\"A slow, suspenseful pan through a mid-90s suburban dining and living room, steeped in darkness, ends on a boxy television set flickering with a regional weather forecast.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.webm?t=1757962728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.mp4?t=1757962728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Grandma has changed\u2014and not for the better. Tonight, something ancient takes hold of her, twisting her into a vessel for the Devil itself. Before the darkness fully claims her, she leaves you one final warning: whatever you do\u2026 <strong>DON\u2019T LOOK AT GRANDMA.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside, descend into Grandpa\u2019s hidden chamber, and attempt the ritual that might save her soul\u2014if you can make it through the night.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perform the Ritual</strong> \u2013 Search every shelf, drawer, closet, and cabinet for five sacred heirlooms needed to banish the Devil and save Grandma's soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Look at Grandma</strong> \u2013 The Devil only wins if you make eye contact, and Grandma has a way of appearing where you least expect her...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets Beneath the House</strong> \u2013 Discover the origins of a generational curse and uncover long-buried truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Horror</strong> \u2013 Each run reveals new ritual items, curses, and blessings, daring you to face fresh challenges and surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light the flames. Gather the heirlooms. Face the Devil. Complete the ritual. <br>And whatever you do\u2026 <strong>DON\u2019T LOOK AT GRANDMA. </strong> <br><br><i>Developer note:\u00a0 Grandma's house is a loving recreation of my actual Grandma's house, circa 1996!</i></p>","developers":["Danger Sauce LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/3418a29e01574449954ea5c22456f876946cf398/header.jpg?t=1757962728","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2